---
source: crates/tds_cli/tests/ui.rs
description: "fn consume(s: take String):\n    print(s)\n\nfn main():\n    let message = \"hi\"\n    for i in 0..<3:\n        consume(take message)\n"
---
error[TDS0411]: `message` is moved inside a loop
  ┌─ TDS0411-moved-in-loop.tds:7:17
  │
5 │     let message = "hi"
  │         ------- `message` is declared outside the loop
6 │     for i in 0..<3:
7 │         consume(take message)
  │                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^ moved here, in one iteration
  │
  = note: the next iteration would use the value after it was moved
  = help: move a copy instead: `take message.clone()`
  = help: or give it a new value before the iteration ends
